  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Programme to support accountability and inclusion (Programme d&apos;Appui &#xe0; la Redevabilit&#xe9; et l&apos;Inclusion) (PARI)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This programme aims to increase the transparency, accountability and effectiveness of governance institutions at central level and in selected provinces to deliver better pro-poor services and support democracy and lasting stability in DRC.</narrative>
  </description>
